(LEGAL-006 - OPERATIVE CLAUSES & STATUTORY DIRECTIVES \(PAGE 2\)) Tj T*
(Title: Tamil Nadu Farmers' Management of Irrigation Systems Act, 2000 \(Act 7 of 20) Tj T*
(Addressed / Competent Officer: Competent Authority \(Assistant Engineer WRD\) & WUA President) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 1: Section 17 \(Functions of Water Users Association\)) Tj T*
(Section 17 empowers the Water Users Association \(WUA\) of a tank to prepare and) Tj T*
(implement the rotational water-supply schedule \(Warabandi\), maintain irrigation) Tj T*
(channels and sluices, and report any unauthorised water drawal or encroachment to) Tj T*
(the Competent WRD Authority.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 2: Section 28 \(Offences & Penalties for Sluice Tampering\)) Tj T*
(Whoever damages, alters, enlarges, or obstructs any tank bund, sluice \(\),) Tj T*
(calingulah \(\), or supply channel commits a cognizable statutory offence) Tj T*
(punishable under Section 28.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
